[[Stone Summit Gnasher]]s are the [[minion master]]s of the [[Stone Summit]]. If left unchecked, they are capable of raising a large [[minion]] army that will pose a significant threat to the party. In [[Guild Wars Eye of the North]], their updated skill bar makes them even more effective minion masters.

The best way to deal with them is to take them down as early as possible. Alternatives would be to prevent them from [[Corpse#Exploiting a Corpse|exploiting]] [[corpse]]s or to bring skills that are devastating to minions or [[summoned creature]]s (such as [[Avatar of Balthazar]], [[Verata's Aura]], and [[Holy Spear]], to name a few). Also, abusing their use of [[Plague Touch]] can draw them into the middle of your group, effectively separating them from their group, making it easy to take them out first.

