==Notes==
*It is highly recommended to bring anti-summon skills, or minion countering skills if parties know they will be facing several of these foes.
*If not careful Gnashers will use corpses to quickly overpower even the strongest parties.
*Skills like [[Verata's Gaze]], [[Verata's Aura]], and [[Holy Spear]] are particularly useful against these enemies.
*On Hard mode, especially in the Eye of the North Campaign, these foes should be killed first when encountered in mobs.
